      "THE_FINDING": {
        "Admissibility": "names ONE fixed nearest-neighbor rule and says the available possibilities 'are determined by, and vary with, the nearest-neighbor conditions'.  It quantifies over the available set.  It does not order it, index it, number it, or nominate a member.  There is no 'first' possibility and no do-nothing possibility in the axiom.",
